  "title": "Tuna Zucchini Elbow Pasta",
  "description": "This tuna zucchini elbow pasta recipe is easy and incredibly delicious. The combo of zucchini, tuna, sauce, and pasta creates a light, flavorful meal.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
